      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "実はこれ、ミテラスさんにもらったんですよ。\n以前、「おふくろの味」で失敗したことがあったので、\n頑張ってまた作ってくれたみたいで。",
      "jp_sha256": "64321e4e3b5d0f0132deda0a37ef0871b928a81016d2577c1f994151db24789e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "사실 이거 미테라스 씨에게 받았어요.\n전에 『어머니의 손맛』으로 실패한 적이 있어서\n열심히 다시 만들어 준 모양이에요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "01f88cb6c853d93bb5eefcfbe4d7b323e8c9db738bc5d498dc5ffa6d3d42a598:000002_6157670612106220184:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "実はこれ、ミテラスさんにもらったんですよ。\n以前、「おふくろの味」で失敗したことがあったので、\n頑張ってまた作ってくれたみたいで。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "16a40d1e46658b149983c20c642399cc2fe2dfad25cc08700dfbab1a6f66bc35",
